[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148417195","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109268#issuecomment-3148417195","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109268","id":3148417195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67qQir","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-03T13:15:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T13:15:14Z","body":"I think the Godot/GDScript type system needs to be unified. We shouldn't just keep adding case-by-case hacks on top of existing design problems and increase the technical debt in this area.\r\n\r\nFor example, you introduce `PROPERTY_HINT_WEAKREF_TYPE` in addition to the existing `PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY_TYPE` and `PROPERTY_HINT_DICTIONART_TYPE`. What if we want to add typed `PackedScene`, add another hint type? You've already written quite a lot of code, but I think there's at least as much left (similar to `ContainerTypeValidate`, GDExtension and C# bindings, etc.). Adding a single typed container shouldn't require so much code and affect so many files.\r\n\r\nThanks for your efforts, but I doubt this PR will be merged for the reasons mentioned above, so I wanted to warn you as early as possible to avoid unnecessary work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148417195/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148432132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109268#issuecomment-3148432132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109268","id":3148432132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67qUME","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-03T13:41:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T13:41:24Z","body":"That's fair! Tbh, it wasn't really that much work. Most of the code was copy-edited. All that's left is to add tests.\r\n\r\nTechnical debt is a legitimate concern. I can understand that! :)\r\n\r\nI didn't plan to add anything else to this PR other than tests. The only intention was to add to GDScript, not to C# or anywhere else.\r\n\r\nC# natively has generics (I don't know if those work with Godot, so I might be assuming incorrectly) but those could be used by people where they need similar behaviour. Typed WeakRefs aren't required in C++ because you can just use pointers I think? This is specifically for GDScript, because we don't have anything like generics/templates, and don't have access to pointers. I don't think there's any plans for implementing as such? I don't even know for sure how that would work on an implementation level?\r\n\r\nFor the most part, the code in this PR functions as syntactic sugar, with no real changes to the API or engine. Just adds layers of type validation where needed, and gives extra information to the parser/analyzer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148432132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148496110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109268#issuecomment-3148496110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109268","id":3148496110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67qjzu","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organ